---
type Props = {
	lang: 'es' | 'en';
};

const { lang } = Astro.props;
const isEs = lang === 'es';
---

<div class="ci-screen" data-lang={lang}>
	<div class="ci-shell">
		<div class="deck-card">
			<div class="deck-nav-bar">
				<div class="deck-slide-indicator">
					<span class="deck-step-dot"></span>
					<span id="deck-slide-label">SLIDE 1 / 7</span>
				</div>
				<div class="deck-pills">
					<button class="deck-pill-btn active" data-target-slide="1">1. {isEs ? 'Clase Abstracta' : 'Abstract Class'}</button>
					<button class="deck-pill-btn" data-target-slide="2">2. {isEs ? 'Interfaces: El Enchufe' : 'Interfaces: Universal Plug'}</button>
					<button class="deck-pill-btn" data-target-slide="3">3. {isEs ? 'Métodos default y Diamante' : 'default Methods & Diamond'}</button>
					<button class="deck-pill-btn" data-target-slide="4">4. {isEs ? 'is-a vs can-do' : 'is-a vs can-do'}</button>
					<button class="deck-pill-btn" data-target-slide="5">5. {isEs ? 'Packages y Colisiones' : 'Packages & Collisions'}</button>
					<button class="deck-pill-btn" data-target-slide="6">6. {isEs ? 'UML: Asociación a Composición' : 'UML: Association to Composition'}</button>
					<button class="deck-pill-btn" data-target-slide="7">7. {isEs ? 'Simulador Medios de Pago' : 'Payment Simulator'}</button>
				</div>
			</div>

			<div class="ci-viewport">
				<!-- SLIDE 1: ABSTRACT CLASS -->
				<div class="deck-slide active" data-slide="1">
					<div class="deck-slide-grid">
						<div class="deck-col">
							<h2 class="deck-slide-title">1. {isEs ? 'Clase Abstracta: El Molde Incompleto en Memoria' : 'Abstract Class: The Incomplete Blueprint in Memory'}</h2>
							<p class="deck-text">
								{isEs
									? 'Una clase abstracta representa un concepto que no puede existir por sí mismo en el mundo real (ej. "Figura"). El compilador prohíbe taxativamente hacer new Figura(); solo sus subclases concretas completas pueden nacer en el Heap.'
									: 'An abstract class models a concept that cannot exist on its own in the real world (e.g. "Shape"). The compiler forbids new Shape(); only complete concrete subclasses can be instantiated in the Heap.'}
							</p>

							<div class="deck-figure">
								<svg viewBox="0 0 540 250" width="100%" role="img" aria-label={isEs ? 'Clase abstracta e instancias concretas' : 'Abstract class and concrete instances'}>
									<!-- Direct Instantiation Attempt Blocked -->
									<g transform="translate(20, 20)">
										<rect x="0" y="0" width="230" height="95" rx="8" class="deck-panel" stroke="rgb(239, 68, 68)" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-dasharray="4 4" />
										<text x="115" y="24" class="deck-svg-title" fill="rgb(239, 68, 68)" text-anchor="middle">new Figura() ✕</text>
										<rect x="30" y="38" width="170" height="42" rx="6" fill="color-mix(in srgb, rgb(239, 68, 68) 12%, var(--color-surface))" />
										<text x="115" y="56" class="deck-svg-bold" fill="rgb(239, 68, 68)" text-anchor="middle">ERROR DE COMPILACIÓN</text>
										<text x="115" y="72" class="deck-svg-sub" text-anchor="middle">Figura is abstract; cannot be instantiated</text>
									</g>

									<!-- Concrete Instances in Heap -->
									<g transform="translate(20, 130)">
										<rect x="0" y="0" width="500" height="105" rx="10" class="deck-panel-accent" />
										<text x="250" y="20" class="deck-svg-title-accent" text-anchor="middle">Heap: Instancias Concretas Válidas</text>

										<!-- Circulo -->
										<g transform="translate(20, 30)">
											<rect x="0" y="0" width="215" height="62" rx="6" class="deck-ground-card" stroke="var(--color-accent)" stroke-width="1.5" id="fig-box-circulo" />
											<text x="15" y="20" class="deck-svg-bold" fill="var(--color-accent-700)">Circulo @0x91A0</text>
											<text x="15" y="36" class="deck-svg-mono-sm">radio = 5.0 | color = "Rojo"</text>
											<text x="15" y="52" class="deck-svg-sub">calcularArea() -&gt; Math.PI * r * r</text>
										</g>

										<!-- Rectangulo -->
										<g transform="translate(265, 30)">
											<rect x="0" y="0" width="215" height="62" rx="6" class="deck-ground-card" stroke="var(--color-divider)" id="fig-box-rect" />
											<text x="15" y="20" class="deck-svg-bold">Rectangulo @0x91B4</text>
											<text x="15" y="36" class="deck-svg-mono-sm">base = 4.0 | altura = 6.0</text>
											<text x="15" y="52" class="deck-svg-sub">calcularArea() -&gt; base * altura</text>
										</g>
									</g>
								</svg>
							</div>
						</div>

						<div class="deck-col">
							<div class="deck-interactive-card">
								<div class="deck-card-head">
									<span class="deck-badge">{isEs ? 'Inspección de Contrato' : 'Contract Inspection'}</span>
								</div>
								<div class="deck-actions-row">
									<button class="btn btn-secondary fig-btn active" data-fig="circulo">{isEs ? 'Circulo (radio = 5)' : 'Circle (radius = 5)'}</button>
									<button class="btn btn-secondary fig-btn" data-fig="rectangulo">{isEs ? 'Rectángulo (4 x 6)' : 'Rectangle (4 x 6)'}</button>
								</div>
								<div class="deck-info-box">
									<div class="state-row">
										<span class="state-label">{isEs ? 'Clase Base Abstracta:' : 'Base Abstract Class:'}</span>
										<span class="state-val mono">public abstract class Figura</span>
									</div>
									<div class="state-row">
										<span class="state-label">{isEs ? 'Método Abstracto Forzado:' : 'Enforced Abstract Method:'}</span>
										<span class="state-val mono">abstract double calcularArea()</span>
									</div>
									<div class="state-row">
										<span class="state-label">{isEs ? 'Cálculo de Área Resuelto:' : 'Calculated Area Result:'}</span>
										<span class="state-val" id="fig-res-area" style="color: var(--color-accent-700); font-weight: 700;">78.54 u²</span>
									</div>
								</div>
								<pre class="deck-code-snippet"><code id="fig-code-txt"><span class="tok-kw">public abstract class</span> Figura &#123;
  <span class="tok-kw">private</span> String color;
  <span class="tok-kw">public abstract double</span> calcularArea(); <span class="tok-comment">// Sin cuerpo</span>
&#125;</code></pre>
							</div>
						</div>
					</div>
				</div>

				<!-- SLIDE 2: INTERFACES: UNIVERSAL PLUG -->
				<div class="deck-slide" data-slide="2">
					<div class="deck-slide-grid">
						<div class="deck-col">
							<h2 class="deck-slide-title">2. {isEs ? 'Interfaces: El Enchufe y Contrato Universal' : 'Interfaces: The Universal Socket and Contract'}</h2>
							<p class="deck-text">
								{isEs
									? 'Una interfaz es un puerto estándar que desacopla por completo quién consume un servicio de cómo se implementa. El cliente solo habla con la interfaz Exportable sin saber si los bytes van a PDF, Excel o JSON.'
									: 'An interface is a standardized port that decouples the service caller from the underlying implementation. The caller interacts only with Exportable without knowing whether data flows to PDF, Excel, or JSON.'}
							</p>

							<div class="deck-figure">
								<svg viewBox="0 0 540 250" width="100%" role="img" aria-label={isEs ? 'Metáfora de interfaz como puerto universal' : 'Interface universal socket metaphor'}>
									<!-- Client Box -->
									<g transform="translate(20, 75)">
										<rect x="0" y="0" width="115" height="100" rx="8" class="deck-panel" />
										<text x="57" y="30" class="deck-svg-title" text-anchor="middle">Cliente</text>
										<text x="57" y="55" class="deck-svg-mono-sm" text-anchor="middle">ReporteServicio</text>
										<rect x="15" y="70" width="85" height="20" rx="4" class="deck-ground-card" stroke="var(--color-divider)" />
										<text x="57" y="84" class="deck-svg-sub" text-anchor="middle">exportar()</text>
									</g>

									<!-- Central Socket / Interface -->
									<g transform="translate(160, 45)">
										<rect x="0" y="0" width="160" height="160" rx="12" class="deck-panel-accent" stroke-width="2" />
										<text x="80" y="26" class="deck-svg-title-accent" text-anchor="middle">&lt;&lt;interface&gt;&gt;</text>
										<text x="80" y="44" class="deck-svg-bold" text-anchor="middle">Exportable</text>
										<line x1="15" y1="56" x2="145" y2="56" stroke="var(--color-divider)" />
										<text x="80" y="78" class="deck-svg-mono-sm" text-anchor="middle">byte[] exportar();</text>
										
										<!-- Plug Pins -->
										<circle cx="45" cy="110" r="10" fill="var(--color-surface)" stroke="var(--color-accent)" stroke-width="2" />
										<circle cx="80" cy="110" r="10" fill="var(--color-surface)" stroke="var(--color-accent)" stroke-width="2" />
										<circle cx="115" cy="110" r="10" fill="var(--color-surface)" stroke="var(--color-accent)" stroke-width="2" />
										<text x="80" y="142" class="deck-svg-sub" text-anchor="middle">Puerto universal USB</text>
									</g>

									<!-- Concrete Implementations -->
									<g transform="translate(350, 20)">
										<g id="plug-pdf" class="plug-item active-plug" style="cursor: pointer;">
											<rect x="0" y="0" width="165" height="55" rx="6" class="deck-ground-card" stroke="var(--color-accent)" stroke-width="2" />
											<text x="15" y="24" class="deck-svg-bold" fill="var(--color-accent-700)">DocumentoPDF</text>
											<text x="15" y="42" class="deck-svg-sub">implements Exportable</text>
										</g>
										<g id="plug-excel" class="plug-item" transform="translate(0, 68)" style="cursor: pointer;">
											<rect x="0" y="0" width="165" height="55" rx="6" class="deck-ground-card" stroke="var(--color-divider)" />
											<text x="15" y="24" class="deck-svg-bold">ReporteExcel</text>
											<text x="15" y="42" class="deck-svg-sub">implements Exportable</text>
										</g>
										<g id="plug-json" class="plug-item" transform="translate(0, 136)" style="cursor: pointer;">
											<rect x="0" y="0" width="165" height="55" rx="6" class="deck-ground-card" stroke="var(--color-divider)" />
											<text x="15" y="24" class="deck-svg-bold">MensajeJSON</text>
											<text x="15" y="42" class="deck-svg-sub">implements Exportable</text>
										</g>
									</g>
								</svg>
							</div>
						</div>

						<div class="deck-col">
							<div class="deck-interactive-card">
								<div class="deck-card-head">
									<span class="deck-badge">{isEs ? 'Conector de Formatos' : 'Format Socket'}</span>
								</div>
								<div class="deck-actions-row">
									<button class="btn btn-secondary plug-btn active" data-plug="pdf">DocumentoPDF</button>
									<button class="btn btn-secondary plug-btn" data-plug="excel">ReporteExcel</button>
									<button class="btn btn-secondary plug-btn" data-plug="json">MensajeJSON</button>
								</div>
								<div class="deck-info-box">
									<div class="state-row">
										<span class="state-label">{isEs ? 'Tipo de Conexión:' : 'Connection Type:'}</span>
										<span class="state-val mono" id="plug-wire-txt">Exportable exp = new DocumentoPDF()</span>
									</div>
									<div class="state-row">
										<span class="state-label">{isEs ? 'Salida Generada:' : 'Generated Output:'}</span>
										<span class="state-val" id="plug-out-txt" style="color: var(--color-accent-2-700); font-weight: 700;">application/pdf (bytes[])</span>
									</div>
								</div>
								<pre class="deck-code-snippet"><code id="plug-code-txt"><span class="tok-kw">public void</span> procesar(<span class="tok-kw">Exportable</span> exp) &#123;
  <span class="tok-kw">byte</span>[] datos = exp.exportar(); <span class="tok-comment">// Desacople total</span>
&#125;</code></pre>
							</div>
						</div>
					</div>
				</div>

				<!-- SLIDE 3: DEFAULT METHODS & DIAMOND -->
				<div class="deck-slide" data-slide="3">
					<div class="deck-slide-grid">
						<div class="deck-col">
							<h2 class="deck-slide-title">3. {isEs ? 'Métodos default y la Resolución del Diamante' : 'default Methods and Diamond Problem Resolution'}</h2>
							<p class="deck-text">
								{isEs
									? 'Java 8 incorporó métodos default para evolucionar interfaces sin romper implementaciones existentes. Si una clase implementa dos interfaces que definen el mismo método default, el compilador exige resolver la colisión explícitamente.'
									: 'Java 8 added default methods to evolve interfaces without breaking contracts. If a class implements two interfaces declaring conflicting default methods, the compiler mandates an explicit override resolution.'}
							</p>

							<div class="deck-figure">
								<svg viewBox="0 0 540 250" width="100%" role="img" aria-label={isEs ? 'Problema del diamante en interfaces y métodos default' : 'Diamond problem in interfaces and default methods'}>
									<!-- Interface A -->
									<g transform="translate(195, 15)">
										<rect x="0" y="0" width="150" height="40" rx="6" class="deck-panel" />
										<text x="75" y="25" class="deck-svg-bold" text-anchor="middle">Interfaz Base</text>
									</g>

									<!-- Interface B (Left) -->
									<g transform="translate(45, 80)">
										<rect x="0" y="0" width="180" height="55" rx="6" class="deck-panel-accent" stroke="var(--color-accent)" />
										<text x="90" y="20" class="deck-svg-title-accent" text-anchor="middle">Interfaz ImpresoraA</text>
										<text x="90" y="40" class="deck-svg-mono-sm" text-anchor="middle">default void imprimir()</text>
									</g>

									<!-- Interface C (Right) -->
									<g transform="translate(315, 80)">
										<rect x="0" y="0" width="180" height="55" rx="6" class="deck-panel-accent" stroke="var(--color-accent-2-700)" />
										<text x="90" y="20" class="deck-svg-bold" fill="var(--color-accent-2-700)" text-anchor="middle">Interfaz ImpresoraB</text>
										<text x="90" y="40" class="deck-svg-mono-sm" text-anchor="middle">default void imprimir()</text>
									</g>

									<!-- Diamond Arrows -->
									<path d="M135 135 L220 175" stroke="var(--color-accent)" stroke-width="1.5" />
									<path d="M405 135 L320 175" stroke="var(--color-accent-2-700)" stroke-width="1.5" />

									<!-- Class D Collision resolver -->
									<g transform="translate(160, 175)">
										<rect x="0" y="0" width="220" height="60" rx="8" class="deck-ground-card" stroke="var(--color-accent-700)" stroke-width="2" />
										<text x="110" y="22" class="deck-svg-bold" text-anchor="middle">Clase Multifuncion</text>
										<text x="110" y="42" class="deck-svg-mono-sm" fill="var(--color-accent-700)" text-anchor="middle">ImpresoraA.super.imprimir();</text>
									</g>
								</svg>
							</div>
						</div>

						<div class="deck-col">
							<div class="deck-interactive-card">
								<div class="deck-card-head">
									<span class="deck-badge">{isEs ? 'Resolución de Conflicto' : 'Conflict Resolution'}</span>
								</div>
								<div class="deck-actions-row">
									<button class="btn btn-secondary diam-btn active" data-pick="a">{isEs ? 'Elegir ImpresoraA.super' : 'Select ImpresoraA.super'}</button>
									<button class="btn btn-secondary diam-btn" data-pick="b">{isEs ? 'Elegir ImpresoraB.super' : 'Select ImpresoraB.super'}</button>
									<button class="btn btn-secondary diam-btn" data-pick="custom">{isEs ? 'Lógica Propia Nueva' : 'Brand New Logic'}</button>
								</div>
								<div class="deck-info-box">
									<div class="state-row">
										<span class="state-label">{isEs ? 'Colisión de Firmas:' : 'Signature Clash:'}</span>
										<span class="state-val" style="color: rgb(217, 119, 6);">Ambas tienen default void imprimir()</span>
									</div>
									<div class="state-row">
										<span class="state-label">{isEs ? 'Solución Java Obligatoria:' : 'Enforced Java Solution:'}</span>
										<span class="state-val" id="diam-sol-txt" style="color: var(--color-accent-2-700); font-weight: 700;">ImpresoraA.super.imprimir();</span>
									</div>
								</div>
								<pre class="deck-code-snippet"><code id="diam-code-snippet">@Override
<span class="tok-kw">public void</span> imprimir() &#123;
  <span class="tok-kw">ImpresoraA</span>.<span class="tok-kw">super</span>.imprimir(); <span class="tok-comment">// Desambiguación explícita</span>
&#125;</code></pre>
							</div>
						</div>
					</div>
				</div>

				<!-- SLIDE 4: IS-A VS CAN-DO -->
				<div class="deck-slide" data-slide="4">
					<div class="deck-slide-grid">
						<div class="deck-col">
							<h2 class="deck-slide-title">4. {isEs ? 'Herencia vs Implementación: is-a frente a can-do' : 'Inheritance vs Implementation: is-a vs can-do'}</h2>
							<p class="deck-text">
								{isEs
									? 'Una clase solo puede extender una superclase ("is-a", identidad y estado compartido), pero puede implementar infinitas interfaces ("can-do", habilidades ortogonales).'
									: 'A class can only extend one superclass ("is-a", shared identity and state), but it can implement infinite interfaces ("can-do", orthogonal capabilities).'}
							</p>

							<div class="deck-figure">
								<svg viewBox="0 0 540 240" width="100%" role="img" aria-label={isEs ? 'Pato extendiendo Ave e implementando interfaces' : 'Duck extending Bird and implementing interfaces'}>
									<!-- Abstract Base: Ave -->
									<g transform="translate(190, 15)">
										<rect x="0" y="0" width="160" height="50" rx="6" class="deck-panel" />
										<text x="80" y="20" class="deck-svg-title" text-anchor="middle">abstract class Ave</text>
										<text x="80" y="38" class="deck-svg-sub" text-anchor="middle">estado: plumaje, pico (is-a)</text>
									</g>

									<!-- Extends Arrow -->
									<path d="M270 65 L270 95" stroke="var(--color-accent)" stroke-width="2" />
									<polygon points="270,65 264,75 276,75" fill="var(--color-surface)" stroke="var(--color-accent)" stroke-width="1.5" />

									<!-- Concrete Class: Pato -->
									<g transform="translate(180, 95)">
										<rect x="0" y="0" width="180" height="55" rx="8" class="deck-ground-card" stroke="var(--color-accent-700)" stroke-width="2" />
										<text x="90" y="24" class="deck-svg-bold" fill="var(--color-accent-700)" text-anchor="middle">class Pato</text>
										<text x="90" y="42" class="deck-svg-sub" text-anchor="middle">extends Ave</text>
									</g>

									<!-- Interface 1: Volador (Left) -->
									<g transform="translate(30, 165)">
										<rect x="0" y="0" width="150" height="50" rx="6" class="deck-panel-accent" stroke="var(--color-accent-2-700)" />
										<text x="75" y="22" class="deck-svg-bold" fill="var(--color-accent-2-700)" text-anchor="middle">&lt;&lt;Volador&gt;&gt;</text>
										<text x="75" y="38" class="deck-svg-sub" text-anchor="middle">can-do: volar()</text>
									</g>

									<!-- Interface 2: Nadador (Right) -->
									<g transform="translate(360, 165)">
										<rect x="0" y="0" width="150" height="50" rx="6" class="deck-panel-accent" stroke="var(--color-accent-2-700)" />
										<text x="75" y="22" class="deck-svg-bold" fill="var(--color-accent-2-700)" text-anchor="middle">&lt;&lt;Nadador&gt;&gt;</text>
										<text x="75" y="38" class="deck-svg-sub" text-anchor="middle">can-do: nadar()</text>
									</g>

									<!-- Dashed Implementation Lines -->
									<path d="M220 150 L140 165" stroke="var(--color-accent-2-700)" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-dasharray="3 3" />
									<path d="M320 150 L400 165" stroke="var(--color-accent-2-700)" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-dasharray="3 3" />
								</svg>
							</div>
						</div>

						<div class="deck-col">
							<div class="deck-interactive-card">
								<div class="deck-card-head">
									<span class="deck-badge">{isEs ? 'Matriz Comparativa' : 'Decision Matrix'}</span>
								</div>
								<div class="deck-info-box">
									<div class="state-row">
										<span class="state-label">{isEs ? 'Herencia Simple:' : 'Single Inheritance:'}</span>
										<span class="state-val">extends (1 sola clase base)</span>
									</div>
									<div class="state-row">
										<span class="state-label">{isEs ? 'Implementación Múltiple:' : 'Multiple Implementation:'}</span>
										<span class="state-val">implements (N interfaces)</span>
									</div>
									<div class="state-row">
										<span class="state-label">{isEs ? 'Estado en Memoria:' : 'State in Memory:'}</span>
										<span class="state-val">Variables de instancia solo en clases</span>
									</div>
								</div>
								<pre class="deck-code-snippet"><code><span class="tok-kw">public class</span> Pato <span class="tok-kw">extends</span> Ave 
    <span class="tok-kw">implements</span> Volador, Nadador &#123;
  <span class="tok-comment">// Hereda estado de Ave</span>
  <span class="tok-comment">// Cumple contratos de Volador y Nadador</span>
&#125;</code></pre>
							</div>
						</div>
					</div>
				</div>

				<!-- SLIDE 5: PACKAGES & NAMESPACES -->
				<div class="deck-slide" data-slide="5">
					<div class="deck-slide-grid">
						<div class="deck-col">
							<h2 class="deck-slide-title">5. {isEs ? 'Namespaces y Paquetes: Evitar Colisiones' : 'Namespaces and Packages: Collision Avoidance'}</h2>
							<p class="deck-text">
								{isEs
									? 'Los paquetes en Java estructuran el código y resuelven colisiones de nombres mediante el FQCN (Fully Qualified Class Name). Dos clases llamadas Item pueden coexistir si pertenecen a paquetes distintos.'
									: 'Packages provide code geography and prevent name clashes using FQCN (Fully Qualified Class Name). Two classes named Item can coexist cleanly across separate packages.'}
							</p>

							<div class="deck-figure">
								<svg viewBox="0 0 540 240" width="100%" role="img" aria-label={isEs ? 'Colisión de paquetes resuelta por FQCN' : 'Package collision resolved by FQCN'}>
									<!-- Package A -->
									<g transform="translate(25, 30)">
										<rect x="0" y="0" width="220" height="90" rx="8" class="deck-panel" />
										<text x="15" y="24" class="deck-svg-bold" fill="var(--color-accent-700)">package com.tienda.pedidos;</text>
										<rect x="15" y="36" width="190" height="42" rx="4" class="deck-ground-card" stroke="var(--color-accent)" />
										<text x="25" y="60" class="deck-svg-bold">class Item &#123; ... &#125;</text>
